OL,3,AMoney offered by SoS does not go far
OL,4,Aenough, parties say
OL,5,
OL,6,FMoney being offered by the secretary of
OL,7,Fstate to resolve Stormont's budget
OL,8,Fdeadlock does not go far enough, Sinn
OL,9,FFein and the DUP have said.
OL,11,FThe parties were speaking after the
OL,12,Fexecutive met Sir Chris Bryant, who
OL,13,Farrived on Monday for talks about the
OL,14,Fissue.
OL,16,FBBC News NI understands that the
OL,17,Finitial offer to the executive was
OL,18,F#350m a year over the next three years.
OL,19,FBut the executive is believed to have
OL,20,Fsaid it needs #450m annually to meet
OL,21,Fits pressures, leaving a gap of #100m
OL,22,Feach year.
OL,23,APub: 06-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
